        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1007"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1318" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1326">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>with their heads getting big, and the other places not growing... they just turned into a skeleton. </ANNOTATION_VALUE>
